      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/alma_center_wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Green Bay and Western Railroad has supported Alma Center by facilitating freight and passenger transport since the late 19th century.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/alma_center_wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Alma Center is situated in northern Jackson County on the edge of expansive prairie lands that transition into forests to the east.",
